TipsTitle: Search the whole book
TipNames: Type a name: an item, a mob, a boss, a category or a mod. English names and IDs work in any language.
TipConcepts: Type what an item is: a category (buff, wings, whips), the buff it gives (Ironskin), a trait (homing) or a class (summon).
TipDescriptions: Three letters or more also search item descriptions and the Bestiary's texts, below the name matches.
TipCommands: Type > for the book's commands: Deposit All, Quick Stack, the tabs, Help, Settings.
